Then because of the great office of redemption that I had, which had to have supremacy over

222
00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:20.760
everything, it was not fitting to live down below either.

223
00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:29.200
So Jesus, while he was serving the human race to maximum extent, he couldn't be at

224
00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:37.040
their level because if you yourself are dying of cancer, can you help anybody else who is

225
00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:38.480
dying of cancer?

226
00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:42.200
The answer is no.

227
00:22:42.200 --> 00:22:47.360
The person who can help the person dying of cancer is the one who is well, they're in

228
00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:51.640
a different place.

229
00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:59.120
And so Jesus had the office of Redeemer as well, and that isolated him totally.

230
00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:05.800
Therefore it befitted me to live up high above everyone.

231
00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:09.880
This is at the highest level of his being.

232
00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:15.360
And so there had to be that separation between himself and everybody else.

