00:24:37.080 --> 00:24:44.860
And if human supports are given to her, she senses the stench of the human, and she herself

249
00:24:44.860 --> 00:24:47.880
drives them away.

250
00:24:47.880 --> 00:24:56.000
It's very interesting, the stench of the human is that human beings can do good.

