I love the little word almost.

283
00:28:06.000 --> 00:28:09.760
She wasn't allowed because her will is locked into his.

284
00:28:09.760 --> 00:28:16.280
My sweet Jesus moving in my interior, pulling me to himself, told me, 'My daughter, why

285
00:28:16.280 --> 00:28:21.120
