357
00:34:30.120 --> 00:34:37.480
Now as I was thinking about the love with which he suffered so much for us, he told me.

358
00:34:37.480 --> 00:34:43.600
My daughter, my first martyrdom was love.

359
00:34:43.600 --> 00:34:52.840
And love gave birth for me to the second martyrdom, which is pain.

