00:38:33.000 --> 00:38:36.680
Doing something is simply because it's God's will and you're ordered to do it.

398
00:38:36.680 --> 00:38:40.000
That's the position of a servant or a slave.

399
00:38:40.000 --> 00:38:46.560
Doing it out of love is the position of a child.

400
00:38:46.560 --> 00:38:54.040
I learned this when I was very small, and my large family living in a tiny house, and

401
00:38:54.040 --> 00:39:02.760
my mother asked me to tidy the house, and I couldn't even imagine where you would begin,

402
00:39:02.760 --> 00:39:08.640
and I just looked at it in total distress, and she said, "But you...

403
00:39:08.640 --> 00:39:09.680
What do you think of me?"

404
00:39:09.680 --> 00:39:15.800
She said, and I said, "I think you're the greatest mummy on earth."

405
00:39:15.800 --> 00:39:23.800
She was, and she said, "If you want to prove it," she said, "Do what I asked."

406
00:39:23.800 --> 00:39:29.920
Because she said, "Love is proved by actions, not words."

407
00:39:29.920 --> 00:39:34.400
That was a very wise thing to say to a small girl.

