435
00:42:08.960 --> 00:42:15.720
Only company makes everyone happy.

436
00:42:15.720 --> 00:42:23.440
Love must find love, life must find life, joy must find joy, beauty must find beauty,

437
00:42:23.440 --> 00:42:31.800
