00:42:52.080 --> 00:42:59.560
isolation and those few who keep me company that is living with the Lord in a spiritual

443
00:42:59.560 --> 00:43:05.600
life and living in adoration and praise and love, form my refreshment and my happiness

444
00:43:05.600 --> 00:43:10.040
on earth of course because he is eternally happy in heaven.

